==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 30,000 and increases by 30,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the enemy base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mega-Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**30 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 20~23.3 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.3~16.7 seconds<sup>400~500f</sup>.

