==Strategies==
The strategy here varies greatly depending by one's level when attempting this set of stages. Late game players are recommended to just use rushers for the first few stages, while adding some fast units with long distance or units like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] to speed up the process in later stages.

Since the boss spawns when the base takes enough damage, early game players can stall for time with defensive units and build up a small army of Bahamuts, or maybe just one, so that, at least, there can be a strong start. Since the One Horns are quite bulky, using [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] is recommended.

